- Natural Connection (2G - ramp/color fix)\n\
- Hunting Pack (5GG - 8-drop token generator)\n\
- Ravenous Gigantotherium (5GG - 8-drop beater)\n\
- Xyris, the Writhing Storm (2GUR - 5/5 commander synergy)\n\
\n\
**Analysis:**\n\
This hand has 2 lands, which is the minimum viable. With 4 other lands/ramp cards (Chemister's Insight and Natural Connection can help), there's some ramp potential. However, the hand is very heavy on expensive threats (two 8-drops plus Xyris at 5). \n\
\n\
The key issue: I have NO early plays beyond turn 1-2 land drops. This is a mulligan candidate in a 4-player game where I need to establish a presence quickly. Natural Connection can ramp me, and Xyris is castable by turn 3-4 with acceleration, but the ratio of expensive cards to acceleration is poor.\n\
\n\
In multiplayer, a slow start gets punished. I should mulligan to find a hand with better early interaction or more consistent mana + payoffs.\n\
\n\
**Decision:** MULLIGAN\n\
\n\
This is answer=true (YES, mulligan and draw 7 new cards)",
