      "reasoning": "My turn 8! 6 untapped lands, 15 cards in hand (no max hand size from Tishana). Let me plan optimally.\n\
\n\
Play Reliquary Tower first (no max hand size backup + extra mana). Then I can cast multiple Merfolk.\n\
\n\
Sequence:\n\
1. Land: Reliquary Tower → 7 mana available\n\
2. Stonybrook Banneret (1U) → cost reducer, 5 mana left\n\
3. Merrow Reejerey (2U, reduced to 1U) → lord + untap trigger, 3 mana left\n\
4. Deeproot Elite (1G, reduced to G) → +1/+1 counter on each Merfolk ETB, 2 mana left\n\
5. Arcane Signet (2, reduced? No, only Merfolk/Wizard) → 2 mana for ramp\n\
\n\
Actually Stonybrook reduces Merfolk AND Wizard spells. Merrow Reejerey is a Merfolk Wizard. Let me maximize creatures for a lethal swing.\n\
\n\
Plan: Reliquary Tower, then Stonybrook Banneret (1U=2), Deeproot Elite (1G→G with reducer=1), Merrow Reejerey (2U→1U with reducer=2, Reejerey untaps a land when Merfolk cast), Zegana (2GU→1GU with reducer=3). That's 2+1+2+3=8 mana but I only have 7. \n\
\n\
With Reejerey untaps: Cast Banneret (2 mana), cast Deeproot (1 mana, Reejerey not out yet), cast Reejerey (2 mana = 5 total, 2 left), cast Zegana (3 mana but only 2 left + 1 untap from Reejerey = 3). That works!\n\
\n\
Actually let me recount. 7 lands total after Reliquary Tower.\n\
1. Stonybrook Banneret: 1U = 2 lands. (5 left)\n\
2. Deeproot Elite: 1G reduced to G = 1 land. (4 left)  \n\
3. Merrow Reejerey: 2U reduced to 1U = 2 lands. (2 left) Reejerey trigger untaps 1 land = 3 untapped\n\
Wait, Reejerey isn't on the field yet when I cast it. The untap trigger is for OTHER Merfolk cast after Reejerey.\n\
4. Zegana: 2GU reduced to 1GU = 3 lands. I have 2 left. Need 1 more.\n\
\n\
Hmm. What if I cast Arcane Signet before Zegana? Signet costs 2. After step 3 I have 2 lands left. Signet costs 2. Then 0 lands + signet. Not enough for Zegana.\n\
\n\
Alternative: Drop Arcane Signet early.\n\
1. Arcane Signet (2 mana). 5 left.\n\
2. Stonybrook (1U). 3 left.\n\
3. Deeproot (G with reducer). 2 left.\n\
4. Merrow Reejerey (1U with reducer). 0 left. Reejerey untaps... wait, Reejerey triggers on casting a Merfolk, not ETB of Reejerey itself.\n\
\n\
Better plan: \n\
1. Land (Reliquary Tower) → 7 mana\n\
2. Stonybrook Banneret (1U) → 5 mana left\n\
3. Merrow Reejerey (1U with reducer) → 3 mana left  \n\
4. Deeproot Elite (G with reducer) → 2 mana left. Reejerey untaps 1 permanent → 3 mana\n\
5. Zegana (1GU with reducer) → exactly 3 mana. \n\
\n\
And each Merfolk ETB triggers: Kindred Discovery (draw), Deeproot Elite (+1/+1 counter on a Merfolk). Zegana draws a card if I control a creature with +1/+1 counter (Master has one, plus Deeproot will add more). \n\
\n\
Let's go!",
